  "projectType": "general",
  "projectName": "Ara Vector Processor",
  "projectDescription": "Ara is an open-source, scalable 64-bit RISC-V Vector (RVV 1.0) processing unit that operates as a coprocessor to the CVA6 scalar core, supporting configurable lane counts for data-parallel workloads.",
